// [Producer] Queuing order #5
// [Dispatcher] Delivered to carol@example.com
// [Dispatcher] Delivered to alice@example.com
// [Dispatcher] Failed delivery
// [Worker 0] Processing order #4
// [Dispatcher] Sending message to dave@example.com...
// [Worker 2] Processing order #5
// [Dispatcher] Sending message to eve@example.com...
